## 8. Standardized Lexicon & Taxonomy Glossary

| Term / Taxonomy | Category | Clear & Accessible Definition |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **Spirit Beast (*Hunshou*)** | Biology | Indigenous supernatural creatures of Douluo Planet cultivating Heaven and Earth Origin Power, dropping rings upon death. |
| **Emperor Beast (*Rui Shou*)** | Hierarchy | Auspicious destiny-blessed beasts that double cultivation speed of surrounding creatures and influence planar fortune. |
| **Savage Beast (*Xiongshou*)** | Hierarchy | Spirit beasts exceeding 200,000 years of cultivation that survive planar lightning tribulations every 100,000 years. |
| **Sacrifice (*Xianshi*)** | Metaphysics | Voluntary death of a 100k-year beast bestowing its ring, bone, and soul to a human cultivator with zero rejection risk. |
| **Spirit Bone (*Hungu*)** | Regalia | Permanent skeletal implants dropped by deceased beasts granting powerful supplementary abilities without consuming ring slots. |

